INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Update 1.4: The Caverns', '## ⛏ The Caverns
A deep mine full of **mobs**, **bosses** and **every kind of gathering node**. There''s no level requirement, so anyone can go.
- **/warp caverns** takes you there.
- Every **mob kill** in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**. Stronger mobs pay more.
- Every **node** you gather in the Caverns pays **$100 to $10,000**. Higher-level nodes pay more.
- **Bosses** pay the most, up to **$10,000** a kill.
- Kills and nodes still give **Combat**, **profession** and **level XP** as normal.
- There''s a per-minute limit on Caverns cash, so farms can''t print money.

## 📊 Cavern Guide & Trackers
Talk to the new **Cavern Guide** NPC or type **/caverns** to open your Caverns menu:
- What''s down there and how the cash works.
- **Your trackers:** mobs killed, bosses slain, nodes gathered, cash earned, your best payout and time spent in the Caverns.
- Your profession levels and a **Go to the Caverns** button.

## 🛡 Safer Hub & RPG World
- Skills can no longer break or change blocks in the **hub** or the **RPG world**.
- Explosions (TNT, creepers, explosion skills) are blocked in both.
- Skills work exactly the same everywhere else.

## ⚖ Balance
- **Barghests** have been toned down: **40 health**, and their hits are capped at **5 damage** (they can still set you on fire).

[Caverns guide](/guide#caverns) · [Professions guide](/guide#professions)', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 1, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'server-updates'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Update 1.4: The Caverns');
INSERT INTO forum_posts (category_id, title, body, author_name, pinned, published, published_at)
SELECT id, 'Changelog: Update 1.4 (The Caverns)', '## Added
- The Caverns (/warp caverns): a mine full of mobs, bosses and every node type, with no level requirement.
- Cash rewards in the Caverns: $100 to $10,000 per mob kill and per node gathered.
- The Cavern Guide NPC and the /caverns menu, with trackers for kills, bosses, nodes, cash earned, best payout and time spent.
- A Caverns section in the Player Guide.

## Changed
- Barghests: 40 health, and each hit is capped at 5 damage.
- Skills can''t break or change blocks in the hub or the RPG world any more.
- Explosions are blocked in the hub and the RPG world.

## Fixed
- Tensura skills (like absorb) could damage the hub''s builds.', 'OVERTHRONE Staff', 0, 1, strftime('%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ', 'now')
FROM forum_categories
WHERE slug = 'changelog'
  AND NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM forum_posts WHERE title = 'Changelog: Update 1.4 (The Caverns)');
